    "chunk_text": "N.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044507 - 04 (06/2025)\n\nPART III - LANDS Title Registration NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No.: 41/0420 PUTTALAMA DISTRICT IT is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 410093 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the Village of Narakkalliya (Block 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.619 - Mampuriya in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Kalpitiya in the District of Puttalam in the Province of North Western should submit his claim to the undersigned before 11th of June 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 410093 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s Office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. S\u0d82\u0d80\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 08th of May 2025 EOG 06 - 0042/1\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/39 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.04\n\nNo. 2439/39 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 04, 2025"
