    "chunk_text": "I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.08\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.05.20251A\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialis t Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/35 \u2013 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.06.04\n\nNo. 2439/35\u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 04, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare under Sub section (1) of the Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of the said Act.\n\nAll that allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing B/HLE/2016/409 and dated 26.05.2017, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Etampitiya (F.V.P. 197), in Dehiwinipalatha Korale, Pallegama Grama Niladhari Division, No. (55 A)in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Hali Ela, in Badulla District, Uva Province and bounded as follows.:\n\n1A \u2013 G 044503 \u2013 24 (06/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Godamadiththa pathana \u2013 Extent: 0.2023 Hectare North: Lot No. 83B in F.V.P. 197 ; East: Lot No. 83B in F.V.P. 197; South: Lot No. 83B in F.V.P. 197; West: Lot No. 83B in F.V.P. 197\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No. : 4-3/9/2016/WS/320.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.24th January 2025\n\nEOG 06 - 0037\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.04\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.06.20252A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5"
