    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.04\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.06.20252A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\n01. Description of the Servitude - Acquisition of servitude right over and allotment of land for the construction of access road to the Andiambalama Water Tower under Katana Water Supply Project. 02. Description of the Land All that allotment of land described as following name and extent depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GM/KAT/2022/255 and dated 25.10.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the village of Andiambalama,\n\nin Andiambalama East Grama Niladhari Division, No. 155 B, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Katana in Gampaha District, Western Province and bounded as follows. 01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Muwakiriyagodella, Hedawakagahawatta, Muwakiriyawel Godella Pihimbiyagahawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0555 Hectare North: Cad. Map 511204 block 01 Lot No. 222 ; East: Cad. Map 511204 block 01 Lot No. 222 and Cad. Map 511204 block 02; South: Cad. Map 511204 block 01 Lot No. 222; West: Cad. Map 511204 block 01 Lot No. 222.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No. : 4-3/18/2021/WS/09.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.24th January 2025\n\nEOG 06 - 0038\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
