    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/32 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 03 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.03\n\nNo. 2439/32 - TUESDAY, JUNE 03, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nD. S. Ref. No.: DSO/HOM/LAC/84-4,LA/145/2024. Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation\n\nRef. No. : 4-3/5/2020/HW/308.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired : The Allotment in total extent of about 0.0031 Hectare of land in Block No. 04 and Sheet No. 1 in Cadastral Map No. 520042 dated 27.02.2025 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Colombo District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 603C, Munamale-Yakahaluwa in the Village of Kiriwaththuduwa in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama in Colombo District in the Western Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Yakahaluwa Kale, Assessment, No. 1587, Kiriwaththuduwa Road (Left); Description: Garden; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Padukkage Piyadasa\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044500 - 09 (06/2025)\n\nPathmasiri, No. 39, Yakahaluwa, Kiriwaththuduwa, (to finalize the land acquisition process); Extent: 0.0031 Hectare."
