    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044500 - 09 (06/2025)\n\nPathmasiri, No. 39, Yakahaluwa, Kiriwaththuduwa, (to finalize the land acquisition process); Extent: 0.0031 Hectare.\n\nB. A. D. Chinthaka, Divisional Secretary & Land Acquiring Officer, Homagama. At Divisional Secretariat Homagama, 28th May, 2025. EOG 06 - 0031\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.06.03 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.2025\n\nAMENDMENT\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference Number of DS: BD/MY/LND/9/ACQ/26-11\n\nVolume. Ref. No. of Ministry of Land : 03/J/91/HW/257. THE notice under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act published in the Gazette Extraordinary of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka dated 26th January 2015 bearing No. 1899/3 should be amended as \u201cthe ownership inquires will be held on 30th of July 2025 at Divisional Secretariat Mahiyanganaya on 10.00 a.m. and should\n\nappear personally before me, in addition hereby requested to notify to me in writing with two copies of the nature of their interests in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of computation of such amount before 16th June 2025\u201d.\n\nD. M. U. I. N. K. Dissanayake, Acting Divisional Secretary, Mahiyanganaya. At Divisional Secretariat, Mahiyanganaya, 26th May, 2025. EOG 06 - 0033\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
