    "chunk_text": "I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.08\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.05.20251A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialis t Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/29 \u2013 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 03 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.06.03\n\nNo. 2439/29 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 03, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare under Sub section (1) of the Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of the said Act.\n\nThe following land parcels are delineated and bounded as shown in Progress Line No. GM/DIV/2023/138, dated 30.03.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, These Land parcels are situated in Balagalla Village, within the Balagalla West Grama Niladhari Division, Divulapitiya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Gampaha District, Western Province, and are bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Werellagahalanda \u2013 Extent: 0.4141 Hectare North: Bounded by Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.K. Jayakody, Werellagahalanda claimed by Balagalla Model\n\n1A \u2013 G 044502 \u2013 14 (06/2025)\n\n\u0dd9\u0db8\u0db8 \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba www.documents.gov.lk \u0dd9\u0dc0\u0229 \u0d85\u0da9\u026a\u0dd9\u0dba\u01e6 \u0db6\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0dad \u0d9a\u0dc5\u00ab\u0dc4\u0dd0\u0d9a.\n\nPrimary School, Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.M. Jayakody and Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.D.U. Jayakody; East: Bounded by Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.D.U. Jayakody and road; South: Bounded by roadway, Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.A. Jayakody, and Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.A.W. Jayakody; West: Bounded by Werellagahalanda claimed by J.A.A. Jayakody, J.A.A.W. Jayakody, Balagalla Model Primary School, and J.A.M. Jayakody."
