reby appoint\n\nMr. Obadage LeelarathnaAttorney-at-law,No. 242,Sri Sobhitha Mawatha,Nagoda,Kaluthara.\n\nto be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration. Dr. A\u0d87\u0d82\u0d85 J\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a F\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d88, Minister of Labour."
